				<article class="elementor-portfolio-item elementor-post elementor-filter-895 elementor-filter-951 post-77646 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-business-services category-featured">
			<a class="elementor-post__thumbnail__link" href="https://www.aspirantsg.com/free-places-to-watch-singapore-ndp-2026-fireworks-at-national-stadium/">
				<div class="elementor-portfolio-item__img elementor-post__thumbnail">
